      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5A  Install\n\nDocker Engine + Tailscale in WSL2\nUbuntu.\nCheck: systemctl is-system-running\n(enable systemd; turn off Desktop WSL\nintegration)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b3",
      "originalText": "5A  Install\n\nDocker Engine + Tailscale in WSL2 Ubuntu.\nCheck: systemctl is-system-running\n(enable systemd; turn off Desktop WSL integration)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6jDaUaZL4TG8VYYPG_jZz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 357.3024444580078,
      "y": 144.75,
      "width": 235.39511108398438,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 650375199,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 265370225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5B  Connect\n\nsudo tailscale up;  tailscale ip -4\nping the other PCs, then\ntailscale status  (idle = ping first)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b4",
      "originalText": "5B  Connect\n\nsudo tailscale up;  tailscale ip -4\nping the other PCs, then\ntailscale status  (idle = ping first)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_ojcAP2jB3SeW6JDjhUTJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660.7635345458984,
      "y": 144.75,
      "width": 278.4729309082031,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1513002047,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2093654303,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5C  Firewall\n\nufw allow in on tailscale0 to any\nport 2377/tcp, 7946/tcp+udp, 4789/udp\n(nothing in the cloud VPC)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b5",
      "originalText": "5C  Firewall\n\nufw allow in on tailscale0 to any\nport 2377/tcp, 7946/tcp+udp, 4789/udp\n(nothing in the cloud VPC)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3ohivIDqehS0ATf4z6tBY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 983.6285400390625,
      "y": 144.75,
      "width": 282.742919921875,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1827648607,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 58901585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5D  MTU\n\ncreate overlays with\n--opt com.docker.network.driver.mtu=1280\nCheck: eth0 mtu = 1230 in a container",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b6",
      "originalText": "5D  MTU\n\ncreate overlays with\n--opt com.docker.network.driver.mtu=1280\nCheck: eth0 mtu = 1230 in a container",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "k43wdYg-NOJ7jInwamble",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28.781448364257812,
      "y": 359.75,
      "width": 242.43710327148438,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 651677823,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2117543231,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5E  Init\n\ndocker swarm init\n  --advertise-addr $(tailscale ip -4)\nCheck: docker node inspect self",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b7",
      "originalText": "5E  Init\n\ndocker swarm init\n  --advertise-addr $(tailscale ip -4)\nCheck: docker node inspect self",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cYCopuVKjHrmFBhZDAamX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 344.8844909667969,
      "y": 359.75,
      "width": 260.23101806640625,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 27748511,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2626097,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5F  Join\n\ndocker swarm join --token ...\n  <manager 100.x>:2377\nCheck: docker node ls  (Ready/Active)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b8",
      "originalText": "5F  Join\n\ndocker swarm join --token ...\n  <manager 100.x>:2377\nCheck: docker node ls  (Ready/Active)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h19stTbOcytZfzm3PRNtu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 680.0834655761719,
      "y": 359.75,
      "width": 239.83306884765625,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1796144319,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 62793055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5G  Test\n\nTest 1: web-test on 8080\ndocker service rm web-test\nTest 2: overlay + service discovery",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b9",
      "originalText": "5G  Test\n\nTest 1: web-test on 8080\ndocker service rm web-test\nTest 2: overlay + service discovery",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WcdZrP7gNvXmiQIJgzXOl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1007.1274642944336,
      "y": 359.75,
      "width": 235.7450714111328,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1185877215,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 984130577,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563150037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5H  Clean up\n\ndocker service rm ...; network rm ...\ndocker swarm leave\n(NOT prune -a --volumes)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b10",
      "originalText": "5H  Clean up\n\ndocker service rm ...; network rm ...\ndocker swarm leave\n(NOT prune -a --volumes)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
